  "description": "Official time 1:58:44\n\nA lot of snafus but I’m continuing to learn. Blew my skin getting too aggressive trying to pass people on powdery skinner on the second climb, which then caused me to slip off the track giving me a nice extra fourth booter right before the transition point. That threw me off my game and I briefly lost a ski right after that transition because I was flustered. I kinda got my head back in it after that but not really - was too scared to pass people and I didn’t ski downhill super well. Fun though!\n\nApparently I signed up for the rec division so why did I carry so much gear??",
